  triage:title "HTTP_API_VERSION collides with PR #1381's already-landed bump" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/protocol.rs:100 -- HTTP_API_VERSION still \"1.4.0\", matching this branch's own (now-superseded) sprint doc text. This branch forked before PR #1381 (issue #1378) landed its own 1.3.0->1.4.0 bump on develop, and before PR #1384 cascaded AZ.3's plan docs to the corrected 1.4.0->1.5.0 sequencing. That doc correction was never applied to this branch's code. Confirmed present at head 6937c547f. Fix: rebase onto develop (post #1381/#1384), bump HTTP_API_VERSION to 1.5.0, update both openapi.yaml files' version field and inline baseline prose, docs/atm-daemon/http-api.md, the ADR-061 D5 record (sequenced after the roster-state 1.3.0->1.4.0 entry), and review crates/atm-http-runtime/tests/http_v1_3_compat.rs (the immediately-prior baseline is now 1.4.0, not 1.3.0). Source: schema-reviewer, QA-1 on PR #1382 (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1382#issuecomment-5612459494)." ;
